t-center justify-center text-4xl lg:text-7xl"> What are people saying </h1><div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 mt-10 lg:mt-20 justify-center lg:px-20 gap-5"><div class="border rounded-[3px] border-gray-800 px-4 py-4"><h1 class="text-lg font-sans text-gray-400"> I am extremely satisfied with the services provided. The team was responsive, professional, and delivered results beyond my expectations. </h1><div class="flex gap-4 mt-8"><img src="'+ba+'" alt="" class="w-12 rounded-full"><div class="flex flex-col"><h1>John Doe</h1><em class="text-sm text-gray-600">Stellar Solutions</em></div></div></div><div class="border rounded-[3px] border-gray-800 px-4 py-4"><h1 class="text-lg font-sans text-gray-400"> I couldn&#39;t be happier with the outcome of our project. The team&#39;s creativity and problem-solving skills were instrumental in bringing our vision to life </h1><div class="flex gap-4 mt-8"><img src="'+wa+'" alt="" class="w-12 rounded-full"><div class="flex flex-col"><h1>Jane Smith</h1><em class="text-sm text-gray-600">Blue Horizon Technologies</em></div></div></div><div class="border rounded-[3px] border-gray-800 px-4 py-4"><h1 class="text-lg font-sans text-gray-400"> Working with this company was a pleasure. Their attention to detail and commitment to excellence are commendable. I would highly recommend them to anyone looking for top-notch service. </h1><div class="flex gap-4 mt-8"><img src="'+Ea+'" alt="" class="w-12 rounded-full"><div class="flex flex-col"><h1>David Johnson</h1><em class="text-sm text-gray-600">Quantum Innovations</em></div></div></div><div class="border rounded-[3px] border-gray-800 px-4 py-4"><h1 class="text-lg font-sans text-gray-400"> Working with the team at XYZ Company was a game-changer for our project. Their attention to detail and innovative solutions helped us achieve our goals faster than we thought possible. We are grateful for their expertise and professionalism! </h1><div class="flex gap-4 mt-8"><img src="'+Ra+'" alt="" class="w-12 roun